      "topic": "Partially populated aggregate",
      "details": "List initializes with six zeros and any available pair may make generic numeric Validator pass; aggregate non-None alone does not prove all three pairs received. Preserve per-pair received/sequence/age flags; unreceived joints missing, not numeric zeros."
    },
